<title>JAPAN: Tokyo stocks close to bottom - Dresdner strategist.</title>
<headline>Tokyo stocks close to bottom - Dresdner strategist.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Kleinwort Benson (Asia) Ltd strategist, Peter Tasker, believes the Tokyo stock market is near its bottom, Dresdner said on Friday.</p>
<p>This is based on his assessment that the current share prices are reasonable, considering their valuation, it said.</p>
<p>Dresdner also said he has focused on the electronics sector.</p>
</text>
